.TH FP620KP-SETUP 1 "2026-11-10" "printer-driver-fp620kp 0.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fp620kp-setup \- create or update a CUPS queue for the Jolimark FP-620K+
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sudo fp620kp-setup
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fp620kp-setup
creates or updates a CUPS print queue that uses the
.B fp620kp
backend and the installed
.IR jolimark-fp620kp.ppd .
It defaults to the first USB printer device,
.IR /dev/usb/lp0 ,
and to the queue name
.IR FP620K .
.PP
The queue is configured for 360x180 dpi and unidirectional printing.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-device " " \fIPATH\fR
Use the USB printer device at
.IR PATH .
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-name " " \fINAME\fR
Use
.IR NAME
as the CUPS queue name.
.TP
.B \-\-default
Set the new queue as the system default printer.
.TP
.B \-\-test
Print the calibration page after the queue has been created.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a short help message.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
sudo fp620kp-setup
sudo fp620kp-setup --device /dev/usb/lp1 --name FP620K2
sudo fp620kp-setup --default --test
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lpadmin (8),
.BR lp (1),
.BR lpstat (1)
